---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const SITE_NAME = import.meta.env.SITE_NAME || "Site Name";
---

<Layout
  title={`${SITE_NAME} - Privacy Policy | Soccer100 & Soccer Streams`}
  description={`${SITE_NAME} - Privacy Policy for Soccer100 and Soccer Streams. Learn how we handle your data and privacy.`}
  keywords={`${SITE_NAME}, Soccer100, Soccer Streams, Privacy Policy`}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-left">
    <div class="mx-3 prose max-w-none theme-text-primary p-8">
      <div>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> March 2026</p>

        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          We do not collect personal information, create user accounts, or build user profiles. However, our servers may generate temporary basic technical logs such as IP address, browser type, device information, and requested pages. These logs are used strictly for security, maintenance, and performance monitoring purposes, and are not linked to any specific individual.
        </p>

        <h2>Advertising Partners</h2>
        <p>
          Our site displays advertisements provided by third-party advertising networks. These partners may use technologies like cookies or device identifiers to deliver relevant ads and measure performance. Any data they collect is subject to their own privacy policies. We do not control, access, or store this information.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
        <p>
          We do not use cookies for analytics or tracking on our site. However, third-party advertisers may place cookies or similar technologies on your device. You can manage or disable cookies through your browser settings, although doing so may affect the relevance of the ads displayed.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>
          Our platform may include links to external websites and streaming sources. We are not responsible for the content, security, or privacy practices of these external sites. We recommend reviewing their policies before interacting with them or sharing any information.
        </p>

        <h2>Data Security</h2>
        <p>
          We implement reasonable technical measures to protect the limited system data generated by our servers. While we strive to protect information, no method of transmission or storage over the internet is completely secure.
        </p>

        <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          This site is intended for users aged 18 and over. We do not knowingly collect or store personal information from individuals under this age.
        </p>

        <h2>Updates to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may revise this privacy policy from time to time. Any updates will be reflected on this page. Continued use of the site after changes are posted indicates your acceptance of the updated terms.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions regarding this privacy policy, please contact us through our contact page.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
